{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40600","headline":"锦江陪兵部郑侍郎话诗着棊 · 李洞","name":"锦江陪兵部郑侍郎话诗着棊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落叶溅吟身，会棊云外人。\n海枯搜不尽，天定着长新。\n月上分题遍，钟残布子匀。\n忘餐二绝境，取意铸陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}